=== Champion Bosses ===
[[Boss]]es are also capable of being champions, but these work much differently from regular monsters as champions. Every champion boss is unique, with individualized adjustments to the attacks and AI of the boss in question, usually specializing in certain aspects of the boss's repertoire to make them harder to deal with. A champion boss may or may not have increased or decreased health, speed, and/or size in comparison to the default version of the boss, depending on the champion in question. Champion bosses are usually not strictly stronger than the default versions of the bosses, having trade-offs with certain stats being lowered and/or certain attacks being weaker or outright inaccessible in exchange for other stats and/or attacks being stronger.

Because every champion boss is unique, the following table contains a brief summation of how they differ from the default bosses. Additional details (including any changes to the differences in versions prior to Repentance) can be found in the pages for each individual boss.

